                "text": "Doctors and nurses shouldn\u2019t have to make the choice between losing their jobs or violating their beliefs by performing abortion. The Conscience Protection Act defends health care workers and empowers them to stand by convictions as they care for their community. Read more below\u00a0\u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/SELkY4GmO2",
