                "text": "We should not be dependent on the Chinese Communist Party for life-saving medicine. China is racing ahead in biotech, and it's putting our national security at risk. That's why I worked to introduce the MAPS Act, which would secure our pharmaceutical supply chains and help end our reliance on China.\nhttps://t.co/BAajJDYzjp",
