                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Yesterday, I had the honor to meet with Christian Jasperson. He is a spunky, upbeat 9 year old, who has faced serious medical challenges in his life. One day, Christian hopes to be a Supreme Court Justice, and I\u2019m confident that one day we may call him Chief Justice Jasperson. Keep it up, Christian!",
