                "reply_count": 21,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Federal regulators are rightfully eager to study the health effects of many chemicals in our water and septic systems, but they haven\u2019t examined the environmental and public health risks of chemical abortion drugs like mifepristone in those same systems. Scientific research on the health effects of water sources where there are trace amounts of a chemical that is designed to end the life of a child in the womb should not be controversial.\nhttps://t.co/ZGP1z9k9XX",
