                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Right now, medical residents are required to opt out of participating in abortion training if they don't want to participate in an abortion. That\u2019s not what the law allows.\n\nThat\u2019s why my colleagues and I are calling on HHS and CMS to fix this. We\u2019re asking them to make it clear that abortion training must be opt-in only, meaning no one is coerced into it, and that medical programs must follow the law if they want to receive federal graduate medical education funding and Medicare reimbursements.",
